entries.content:
状态栏:
  rule:
    - You must output the status bar wrapped in <StatusBlock> tags at the bottom of each reply, and update its content based on interactions in real-time
  format:
    basic: |-
      <StatusBlock>
      <small>
      ```yaml
      『${YYYY-MM-DD$} ${week$} ${time$} - ${故事开始后的'第X天'$} - ${<user>所处的地点$} - ${weather/atmosphere emoji$}』
      ■ 周围地点: ${List several locations in one sentence, aiming to guide <user>'s next action$}
      ■ 特殊状态:
        - ${Status name, omit status that has ended$}: ${Summarize the effect, affected character and remaining duration in one sentence$}
      ■ 近期事务:
        - ${Briefly record recent tasks that need to be completed by <user>. Listed tasks will remain until completed or abandoned, but task timing and content may be adjusted based on the plot. Completed tasks will no longer be displayed$}

      ■ ${角色名称，仅显示当前剧情正在描写的主要角色（主要角色:艾琳、菲丝、卡娅、莉娅）$}
        ❤️ 心情: ${Use ↑↓→ to show character's mood change towards <user>, with reason, e.g. ↑(<user>夸奖), max 15 chinese words$}
        💗 情欲: ${current stage based on `情欲值` variable$}(${value of `情欲值` variable$}/100)
        👹 堕落值: ${具体数值$}(${色情淫荡地描述最近一次堕落值变化的数值和原因，30字之内$})
        💦 高潮次数: ${具体数值$}(${色情淫荡地描述最近一次高潮的地点和方式，60字之内$})
        📍 位置: ${角色所处的位置$}
        👗 衣着: ${Describe character's current clothing in lewd, erotic, lewd terms and detail, update in real-time, max 20 chinese words$}
        👄 身体: ${Detailed description focusing on each body part, including sound, form, color, smell, sense and overall feeling to create realistic experience in erotic and lewd terms, 40-60 chinese words$}
        🏃‍♀️ 行动: ...
        💭 想法: ${Character's first-person monologue$}
        ${special status$}

      ■ 周围人物: ${if no other characters nearby, output '无' and possibly ouput the reason$}
        - ${characters nearby not currently interacting with <user>$}: ${A concise description of what this character is doing$}
      ```
      </small>
      </StatusBlock>
    special status:
      艾琳: |-
        ❤️ 菲丝好感度: ${具体数值$}(${描述最近一次变化的数值和原因，30字之内$})
      卡娅: |-
        ❤️ 菲丝好感度: ${具体数值$}(${描述最近一次变化的数值和原因，30字之内$})        
      莉娅: |-
        ❤️ 卡娅好感度: ${具体数值$}(${描述最近一次变化的数值和原因，30字之内$})
      菲丝: |-  
        ❤️ 卡娅好感度: ${具体数值$}(${描述最近一次变化的数值和原因，30字之内$})

